</div>

<!-- COMMITMENTS -->
<section class="au2-commit">
  <div class="au2-wrap">
    <div class="au2-text">
      <span class="au2-label">What we promise</span>
      <h2 style="font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,38px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.025em;line-height:1.15;margin-bottom:24px;">What we will never do — and what that costs us</h2>
      <p style="font-size:16px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:18px;">We carry manufacturer-backed warranties, full white-glove delivery, and in-house service technicians. Those are table stakes in this category. What sets us apart doesn't appear on a spec sheet.</p>
      <div class="au2-pull">
        <p>"We will never manufacture urgency. We will never steer based on margin. We will never disappear after delivery day."</p>
      </div>
      <p style="font-size:16px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:18px;">We don't make vague claims about what massage can cure. The science is clear and limited — massage shows documented benefit for stress, certain musculoskeletal tension, and sleep quality at the margins. We help you find a chair that, used consistently, might meaningfully improve how your body feels after a long day. That's not a hedge. It's what honesty looks like in an industry that habitually oversells.</p>
      <p style="font-size:16px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.9;">Holding to these commitments has cost us transactions. We've had visitors choose a cheaper option elsewhere after a long conversation with one of our advisors. We've recommended against chairs with better margins. We've told people to go home and sleep on it — and meant it. That has never changed, because it's what built every referral we've ever received.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FINAL CTA -->
<section class="au2-final">
  <div class="au2-wrap">
    <div class="au2-final-grid">
      <div>
